  "display_fullname": "Scrapper Defense Ninjitsu Shinobi-Iri",
  "display_help": "Shinobi Iri are the ninjitsu techniques of silent movement and infiltration. These skills allow you to move at high speed, whether on the ground or leaping from rooftop to rooftop. This power also grants you defense against all positional attacks. While stealthed, you have a very high chance of landing a critical attack, however you can only attempt this after spending 20 seconds without attacking. This power cant be used at the same time as other stealth powers.",
